<title>SWEDEN: P&amp;U says expects 1998 to be better than '97.</title>
<headline>P&amp;U says expects 1998 to be better than '97.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The new chief executive of Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn, Fred Hassan, said on Monday he expected 1998 to be a better year than 1997.  </p>
<p>&quot;My aim is to exploit the sales advantage P&amp;U has on all markets,&quot; Hassan told a telephone conference.</p>
<p>&quot;With this, I'm convinced that 1998 will be a better year than 1997. We will stabilise the situation in the company as quickly as possible.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Jorgen Osterberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1008</p>
